								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Nothin better than crackin open a ice cold BOTTLE of yer favorite lager out of the ice chest! ;D &nbsp;<br /><br />Natty isnt all that bad, shit if yer low on dough it werks. &nbsp;Steel Reserve ...some potent ass beer, all in all Red Dog is prolly one of the nastiest tastin shit. &nbsp;<br /><br />Back in the day coming back from the river we would drink hot ass budwiesers left in the car, big mistake. &nbsp;:-X<br /><br />German Beers &gt;
						</td>
